OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny spells, the
OL,7,Fbest of these in the east. The odd
OL,8,Fshower possible over western areas of
OL,9,FCentral and Tayside where it will also
OL,10,Fbe cloudier.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening and overnight
OL,13,Fwill be mostly cloudy with the odd
OL,14,Fshower in the west. The east will be
OL,15,Fdry with clearer spells. Not quite as
OL,16,Fcold as previous night.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,19,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,20,Fintervals breaking through. Outbreaks
OL,21,Fof rain in the evening. Windy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
